    skos:prefLabel "Adoption of reform" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use for adoption or implementation of reforms that alter governance, institutional, or organizational rules and arrangements. Exclude adoption, feasibility, fidelity, penetration, or sustainability outcomes for a clinical service or program unless the measured change is itself an institutional reform." ;
