    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Acute and chronic neurologic disorders associated with the various neurologic effects of ETHANOL. Primary sites of injury include the brain and peripheral nerves." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D020268> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "D020268" ;
