    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Disorders damaging the nerve network that supplies the shoulder and upper limb, with possible pain, weakness, or sensory loss." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D020516> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "D020516" ;
