    skos:prefLabel "Budget allocation" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use for institutional budgets and resource assignments, including the sector-specific child DefenseSpending. Exclude individual or survey respondents' hypothetical allocations and preferences over who or what should receive resources; use DistributionalPreferences for those measures." ;
