    skos:prefLabel "Cancer survivorship" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use for the lived post-diagnosis condition of cancer survivors, including late effects, functioning, wellbeing, participation, and survivorship-care needs. Use Survival for time-to-event or alive-without-event outcomes, Mortality for deaths or death rates, NeoplasticDiseases for active tumor pathology, HealthServiceUse for receipt of survivorship services, and Durability for implant or device survivorship." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> .

