    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/Carcinoma> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A carcinoma with a predominantly cellular growth pattern and relatively little supporting stroma; the specific meaning also depends on the organ involved." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D018276> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "D018276" ;
