    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Congenital, inherited, or acquired anomalies of the CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM, including the HEART and BLOOD VESSELS." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D018376> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "D018376" ;
