    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Dimpling or unevenness of the skin surface associated with the structure of underlying subcutaneous fat, commonly affecting the thighs, buttocks, or abdomen." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000071697> ;
