    skos:scopeNote "Use for the cost burden of childrearing itself. Use CostPerceptions for beliefs about the cost of children, HouseholdResourceAllocation for how resources are distributed among household members, and HealthCareCosts for provider, program, or treatment costs reported per child." ;
