    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A type of chromosomal aberration involving DNA BREAKS. Chromosome breakage can result in CHROMOSOMAL TRANSLOCATION; CHROMOSOME INVERSION; or SEQUENCE DELETION." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D019457> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "D019457" ;
