    skos:inScheme state: ;
    skos:prefLabel "Experience-based decision-making" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use when direct sampling or outcome feedback is the information source for a choice. Do not use merely because the decision-maker is experienced or an expert; use Expert judgment for expertise-based assessments, Personal experience for experience as an exposure without a decision process, and Uncertainty learning when belief updating rather than the resulting choice is the focus." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> .

