    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Congenital interruption or closure of the intestinal lumen that prevents normal passage of contents." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007409> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/> ;
