    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Lack of stability of a joint or joint prosthesis." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007593> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/> ;
