    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A serious complication of childhood systemic inflammatory disorders that is thought to be caused by excessive activation and proliferation of T-LYMPHOCYTES and MACROPHAGES. It is seen predominantly in children with systemic onset JUVENILE IDIOPATHIC ARTHRITIS." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D055501> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Macrophage activation syndrome" ;
    <https://universalevidence.com/ontology/bearer> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> .

<https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/Macrostomia>
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-06-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008265> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
