    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/BurkholderiaInfections> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A disease of humans and animals that resembles GLANDERS. It is caused by BURKHOLDERIA PSEUDOMALLEI and may range from a dormant infection to a condition that causes multiple abscesses, PNEUMONIA and BACTEREMIA." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008554> ;
