    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Benign and malignant neoplastic processes that arise from or secondarily involve the meningeal coverings of the brain and spinal cord." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008577> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Meningeal neoplasms" ;
    <https://universalevidence.com/ontology/bearer> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> .

