<https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/Meningioma>
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "From DeVita et al., Cancer: Principles and Practice of Oncology, 5th ed, pp2056-7" ;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-06-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
