    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/CongenitalSkinAndEctodermalAbnormalities> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rare autosomal recessive disease with variable expressions. Clinical features of the disease include variable ICHTHYOSIFORM ERYTHRODERMA, CONGENITAL; bamboo hair (trichorrhexis invaginata); and ATOPIC DERMATITIS. The disease is caused by mutations in the SPINK5 gene." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D056770> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Netherton syndrome" ;
    <https://universalevidence.com/ontology/bearer> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> .

