    skos:altLabel "Fibroma, Ossifying" ;
    skos:broader state:BoneNeoplasms ;
    skos:definition "A benign fibro-osseous neoplasm characterized by fibrous tissue with varying amounts of mineralized bone or cementum-like material." ;
