    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/SalmonellaInfections> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A prolonged febrile illness commonly caused by several Paratyphi serotypes of SALMONELLA ENTERICA. It is similar to TYPHOID FEVER but less severe." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D010284> ;
