    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A neurodevelopmental disorder characterized by loss of previously acquired hand and communication skills, with variable movement, breathing, or seizure-related features." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D015518> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/> ;
