    skos:closeMatch <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000079426> ;
    skos:definition "The persistent burden of infectious diseases transmitted by mosquitoes and other arthropod vectors, including the ecological and epidemiological conditions that sustain vector populations and transmission risk." ;
