    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/PotentiallyInappropriateMedicationRate> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch> <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000069342> ;
