    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cultural diversity gap" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cultural exclusion" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/SocialInclusionAndIdentityStatus> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://unstats.un.org/sdgs/target/4_7> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The persistent suppression, neglect, or under-recognition of cultural identities, expressions, and diversity that limits social cohesion and the wellbeing of minority and indigenous communities." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Erosion of indigenous languages and cultural practices due to assimilationist policies." ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "cultural rights deprivation" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "culture condition" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cultural marginalisation and diversity constraints" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/states/HumanRightsViolations> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch> <https://webfs.oecd.org/crs-iati-xml/Lookup/DAC-CRS-CODES.xml#16061> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Distinct from human rights violations by its specific focus on cultural identity and expression rather than civil or political rights broadly." ;
    <https://universalevidence.com/ontology/bearer> <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> .

